## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the `pcap file` from challenge using `wget`.
2. Open wireshark, click file at `top left and click open` and choose the `pcap file`.
3. Observe the packets one by one clicking on it and see the `packet bytes pane`.
4. The flag will be displayed.



